============================================================
CRITICAL CHANGE #6
ONLY ROTATE A GROUP AFTER SUCCESS
============================================================

This is extremely important.

DO NOT move the current group to the bottom immediately.

Only rotate it after the group scan has completed successfully.

Example:

    Current queue:

        A
        B
        C

If A succeeds:

        B
        C
        A

If A fails:

        A
        B
        C

Therefore:

    SUCCESS → move first line to bottom

    FAILURE → leave first line where it is

This gives the program reliable resume behavior.

